--- !u!114 &3747641007348356881
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 967149305506238808}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "We decided to base this game roughly off the theme of climate change.
    Though we didn't get to write out as much of a story as we hoped due to time,
    our idea was to have the protagonist be one of the few left in a future where
    the world has been ruined by climate change beyond recognition. Mutated fragments
    of the old world flourish here, and you live in one of the few  clean bastions
    left in the world. One day, you decide to pick up your trusty weapon\u2014an
    ancient \"trash grabber\"\u2014to fight back against the demons that have ravaged
    the world, and rebuild the ruined components of environmentally-friendly machines
    that purify the world, bringing it closer to where it was before the old humans
    destroyed everything."
